    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0448" n="350" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg350"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Pauncefote to
                        Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Newport, R. I.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Rumors current here of message to you from Minister Conger. Is it true; and if
                    so, can you communicate anything for information of my Government?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pauncefote.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
